== 6.11 Chapter 6 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [Every chemical industry needs four things. Which of these is NOT one of them?],
  [a market for the product],
  [a cheap raw material],
  [a process that changes it],
  [a guarantee that the product is rare]
)

#mcq(2, [A chemical plant is usually built near its raw material when the raw material is],
  [bulky and cheap],
  [small and expensive],
  [imported],
  [a gas]
)

#mcq(3, [Cement is made from],
  [bauxite and cryolite],
  [sand and soda ash],
  [crude oil and air],
  [limestone and clay]
)

#mcq(4, [The rotary kiln in a cement works reaches a temperature of about],
  [1450 °C],
  [250 °C],
  [800 °C],
  [2500 °C]
)

#mcq(5, [The reaction inside the cement kiln is],
  [SiO₂ + C → Si + CO₂],
  [CaO + CO₂ → CaCO₃],
  [CaCO₃ → CaO + CO₂],
  [2Ca + O₂ → 2CaO]
)

#mcq(6, [Gypsum is added to cement to],
